{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for a tower defense game 65 million years in the making! Assemble a herd of unique dinosaurs to defend against an onslaught of invading insects.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Control the Terrain!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dinos TD flips the tower defense genre on its head! You control the battlefield! Draw the paths your enemies walk on. Place Biome tiles to give your Dinos boons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533920/extras/BuildPlaceDefend.gif?t=1745034473\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dinosaurs! Dinosaurs! Dinosaurs!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a wide range of Dinosaurs each offering a new way to strategize and synergize with the environment and other dinos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533920/extras/DinoShowcase.gif?t=1745034473\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up each Dino to unlock flashy new abilities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533920/extras/Crown_abilities.gif?t=1745034473\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Avoid Extinction!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play around destructive world events like the meteor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533920/extras/Meteor.gif?t=1745034473\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the master of dinosaurs in Dinos TD!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533920/extras/Pterry.gif?t=1745034473\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.s